    "width로 밀도를 고르세요**.wide**(\"5 kilometers\", 문장 속), **.abbreviated**(\"5 km\", 목록·라벨), **.narrow**(\"5km\", 좁은 공간). 시뮬레이터 로케일을 en_US로 바꿔 마일 변환까지 확인하는 게 검증 포인트.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick the density with width: **.wide** (\"5 kilometers,\" inside sentences), **.abbreviated** (\"5 km,\" lists and labels), **.narrow** (\"5km,\" tight spaces). The key check is switching the simulator locale to en_US to confirm the conversion to miles."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick the density with width: **.wide** (\"5 kilometres,\" inside sentences), **.abbreviated** (\"5 km,\" lists and labels), **.narrow** (\"5km,\" tight spaces). The key check is switching the simulator locale to en_US to confirm the conversion to miles."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "widthで密度を選びます。**.wide**（「5 kilometers」、文の中）、**.abbreviated**（「5 km」、リスト・ラベル）、**.narrow**（「5km」、狭いスペース）。シミュレータのロケールをen_USに変えて、マイルへの換算まで確認するのが検証のポイント。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zoom 전환을 **full screen cover에 적용**, 썸네일이 화면 전체로 확대.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The zoom transition **applied to a full-screen cover**, so a thumbnail expands to fill the screen."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The zoom transition **applied to a full-screen cover**, so a thumbnail expands to fill the screen."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zoomのトランジションを**フルスクリーンカバーに適用**。サムネイルが画面全体へ拡大する。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zoom 전환의 가치는 **왕복**에 있다. 확대로 열리고 닫을 때 원래 자리로 축소되어야 공간 모델이 처음부터 끝까지 유지된다. 여는 쪽만 연속이면 \"이 사진은 저 칸에서 왔다\"는 약속을 절반만 지킨 것이다. 돌아갈 자리를 잃으면 격자에서 **내가 어디 있었는지**도 함께 잃는다.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The value of a zoom transition lies in the **round trip**. It has to open by zooming in and shrink back into its original spot on close for the spatial model to hold from start to finish. If only the opening is continuous, you've kept only half of the promise that \"this photo came from that cell.\" Lose the place to return to, and people also lose **where they were** in the grid."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The value of a zoom transition lies in the **round trip**. It has to open by zooming in and shrink back into its original spot on close for the spatial model to hold from start to finish. If only the opening is continuous, you've kept only half of the promise that \"this photo came from that cell.\" Lose the place to return to, and people also lose **where they were** in the grid."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zoomトランジションの価値は**往復**にある。拡大して開き、閉じるときに元の場所へ縮んで戻ってこそ、空間のモデルが最初から最後まで保たれる。開く側だけが連続していても、「この写真はあのマスから来た」という約束を半分しか守っていない。戻る場所を失うと、グリッドの中で**自分がどこにいたのか**も一緒に失う。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zoom은 **눌렀던 것과 열린 것이 같은 것임을 모션으로 증명**하는 장치다. 카드와 그 카드의 상세, 썸네일과 그 사진처럼 확대될 시각적 대응물이 있을 때만 참이다. 작성 버튼은 새 메모의 작은 모습이 아니고, 텍스트 행은 설정 화면의 축소판이 아니다. 대응물이 없는 곳에 zoom을 걸면 모션이 **거짓 관계**를 주장한다. 그러면 진짜 대응이 있는 카드의 zoom까지 덜 믿게 된다.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom is a device that **proves through motion that what you tapped and what opened are the same thing**. It's only true when there's a visual counterpart to zoom from, like a card and its detail, or a thumbnail and its photo. A compose button isn't a tiny version of a new note, and a text row isn't a miniature of a settings screen. Apply zoom where there's no counterpart, and the motion asserts a **false relationship**. Then people trust the zoom even on cards that do have a real counterpart a little less."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom is a device that **proves through motion that what you tapped and what opened are the same thing**. It's only true when there's a visual counterpart to zoom from, like a card and its detail, or a thumbnail and its photo. A compose button isn't a tiny version of a new note, and a text row isn't a miniature of a settings screen. Apply zoom where there's no counterpart, and the motion asserts a **false relationship**. Then people trust the zoom even on cards that do have a real counterpart a little less."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zoomは、**タップしたものと開いたものが同じものであることをモーションで証明する**仕掛けだ。カードとその詳細、サムネールとその写真のように、拡大の元になる視覚的な対応物があるときにだけ真実になる。作成ボタンは新しいメモの小さな姿ではないし、テキストの行は設定画面の縮小版ではない。対応物のないところにzoomをかけると、モーションが**偽りの関係**を主張する。すると、本当に対応のあるカードのzoomまで信じにくくなる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zoom은 최신 API이고 보기에 좋다. 한 화면에 써 보면 앱이 한결 살아 보인다. 이왕 도입했으니 여러 곳에 고르게 걸어 통일감을 주고 싶다. 모든 전환이 같으면 일관돼 보인다고 생각한다.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom is a recent API and looks great. Use it on one screen, and the whole app feels more alive. Since you've adopted it anyway, you want to apply it evenly in many places for a sense of unity. You figure that if every transition is the same, the app will look consistent."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom is a recent API and looks great. Use it on one screen, and the whole app feels more alive. Since you've adopted it anyway, you want to apply it evenly in many places for a sense of unity. You figure that if every transition is the same, the app will look consistent."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zoomは新しいAPIで見栄えがいい。1つの画面で使ってみると、アプリがぐっと生き生きして見える。せっかく導入したのだから、あちこちに均等にかけて統一感を出したい。すべてのトランジションが同じなら一貫して見えると考える。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zoom을 걸기 전에 묻는다. \"무엇이 무엇으로 커지는가?\" 두 이름이 같은 대상을 가리키지 않으면 쓰지 않는다.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before applying zoom, ask: \"What grows into what?\" If the two names don't point to the same thing, don't use it."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Before applying zoom, ask: \"What grows into what?\" If the two names don't point to the same thing, don't use it."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zoomをかける前に問う。「何が何に大きくなるのか」2つの名前が同じ対象を指していなければ使わない。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "zoom이 화려하고 최신 API라 여기저기 써보고 싶다.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom is flashy and a recent API, so you want to try it everywhere."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zoom is flashy and a recent API, so you want to try it everywhere."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "zoomは派手で新しいAPIなので、あちこちで使ってみたくなる。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
